
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Account Upgrade Demo</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #252525;
    }
    header {
      background: #d7193f;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .demo {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      background: white;
      color: #b10d30;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 440px;
      margin: 22px auto;
      padding: 0 15px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 14px #0000000d;
    }
    h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    .level {
      background: #fff0f3;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .levels {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-around;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #c5163b;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .arrow { font-size: 24px; }
    .note {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #d7193f;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover { background: #b91232; }
    #message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 13px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #eaf7ed;
      color: #17672a;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 18px;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">JazzCash-style Demo</div>
    <div>Account Level Information</div>
    <span class="demo">DEMO WEBSITE — NOT OFFICIAL</span>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Upgrade Account</h2>
      <p>Learn about moving from Level 0 to Level 1.</p>

      <div class="level">
        <div class="levels">
          <span>Level 0</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span>Level 1</span>
        </div>
        <p class="note">
          Account verification requirements may vary.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h3>How to upgrade</h3>
      <p class="note">
        1. Open the official JazzCash app.<br>
        2. Check your account verification status.<br>
        3. Follow the instructions shown in the app.<br>
        4. Contact official JazzCash support if you need help.
      </p>

      <button onclick="showInfo()">
        View Demo Instructions
      </button>

      <div id="message" role="status">
        This is only a demonstration. No account has been
        upgraded and no personal information has been collected.
        Use the official JazzCash app for real verification.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Independent demo project · Not affiliated with JazzCash
  </footer>

  <script>
    function showInfo() {
      document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
